		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>You take on the power of the underworld, becoming more like the natural and magical creatures who inhabit the land you protect.</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>You gain &amp;reference[darkvision] out to 120 ft. and &amp;reference[blindsight] out to 60 ft.</p></li><li><p>You can cast <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.vWQiuirTFxetH3lm]{Invisibility}</em> as a 2nd level spell without expending a spell slot.</p></li><li><p>You gain the ability to move up, down, and across vertical surfaces and upside down along ceilings while leaving your hands free.</p></li><li><p>You gain a &reference[climbing]{Climbing} speed equal to your walking speed.</p></li></ul><p>These benefits include a permanent version of @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.LsbceZDIv0Opf29G]{Underworld Eyes} and <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.mGEvLVu25XKdfgsq]{Spider Climb}</em> .</p>",
			"chat": ""
		},
